  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific-European Union Marine Partnership  Programme (PEUMP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to improve the economic, social and environmental benefits for PACP states arising from stronger regional economic integration and the sustainable management of natural resources and the environment. The project purpose is to improve economic, social and environmental benefits from sustainable management of oceanic and coastal natural resources with due regard for the conservation of native biodiversity and climate change adaptation requirements</narrative>
  </description>
